# A Structure of another declaration through an opaque formal is read by name (RECEPTION-EDGE-DEBTS (d)): the
# formal p's place reaches get's formal, so get reads the field its value carries under that name.  The Other's
# `value` is its second field: 9.  Until 2026-10-05 get was not marked as one that reads by name and read by
# position: 1, the Other's first field, with no refusal.  A Model: 4.  Entry 7.
Model:
    size_t: value 4U
end: Model

Other:
    size_t: pad 1U
    size_t: value 9U
end: Other

good: merge: Model
wide: merge: Other

fn: get (Model: x) size_t
return: x\value

fn: run (@: void p) size_t
return: get(p)

size_t: a run(good)
size_t: b run(wide)
int: ok 7
if: a != 4U
    ok: 81
if: b = 1U
    ok: 61
if: b != 9U && b != 1U
    ok: 82
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
